OL,3,ATwo pilots eject and parachute out of
OL,4,ARAF plane before crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo pilots ejected and parachuted out
OL,7,Fof their plane before the RAF training
OL,8,Faircraft crashed and burst into flames,
OL,9,Fappearing to narrowly miss homes.
OL,11,FNorth Wales Police said the pilots of
OL,12,Fthe RAF T2 Hawk aircraft were being
OL,13,Ftreated for minor injuries following
OL,14,Fthe incident in the Pencarnisiog area
OL,15,Fof Anglesey.
OL,17,FThe force said helicopters from the
OL,18,FCoastguard and the Wales Air Ambulance
OL,19,Fwere sent to the scene close to RAF
OL,20,FValley on the island. The pilots have
OL,21,Fbeen taken to Birmingham for treatment.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
